            "rationale": "Multiplicative spectral color: one simple Guide draws the quiet high-frequency attenuation. CC2 fades that attenuation to neutral at full breath. The spectrum comes from the pulse FFT; multiplication preserves its absent half-harmonics and passes its phase to IFFT. No additive filling.",
